The interface bundled in the jar
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The web interface is served by the jar from `static/`. The notices of the npm
packages compiled into it (Angular, Optimus UI, chart.js and the rest, MIT for
most) are in `static/licenses/3rdpartylicenses.txt`, as `ng build` writes them.

Its shell is not a package but code copied into the repository, and so is not in
that file:

